Thu Nov 26 08:00:00 UTC 2026 - Jordi Relats <4889953+jordirelats@users.noreply.github.com>

- Update to 0.4.1, fixes from a review (security, zypper, code,
  interface, language, packaging):
  * Solutions chosen in the dup window run as one 'zypper install'
    transaction that refuses instead of removing what depends on a
    package; the dup window's default button simulates
  * Removals and installs of the queue are simulated and applied as one
    transaction; --no-clean-deps when not asked for
  * Signing key import: exactly one key block, re-exported from a
    throwaway keyring before rpm sees it; vendors' next keys are not
    offered for deletion; Search online queues keys instead of importing
  * Repository address changes add the new repository before removing
    the old one and keep every setting (gpgkey included); "--" before
    every alias
  * The refresh timer follows the wall clock (laptops that suspend),
    downloads ahead only on AC power, and the window says when zypper is
    busy with it; fwupdmgr never uploads reports by itself
  * Unlocking locks with a version range or a repository works; History
    warns that /opt and other subvolumes are not in snapshots
  * The window warns when the root helper is older than the app
  * Faster Applications page, pages fit 1100x700, cleaner package card,
    consistent counts, many wording and translation fixes

