Wed Nov 25 22:30:00 UTC 2026 - Jordi Relats <4889953+jordirelats@users.noreply.github.com>

- Update to 0.4.0:
  * Tray icon with a daily notification about updates (repositories,
    Flatpak, programs from the web, firmware), and a system timer
    (zypp-desk-refresh.timer) that refreshes the repositories as root
    and never installs anything
  * Firmware updates through fwupd in the Updates page
