    keep the snapshot you started from
  * Choose one of zypper's solutions to a dependency problem
  * Signing keys page: see who signs what, delete unused keys, import
    keys from a web address, a file or a fingerprint
  * zypp.conf settings, written to /etc/zypp/zypp.conf.d/50-zypp-desk.conf
  * Graphical routine editor
  * Repository priorities on the cards, a suggested order, and a new
    address for a repository that moved
  * Open downloaded RPM files (Zypp Desk is one more application for
    application/x-rpm), and only one window at a time
  * Remove also what only a package needed (--clean-deps)

